OL,3,GNEWSA'Extremely rare' Roman coins sell
OL,4,Afor #16,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FDominic Chorney, head of ancient coins
OL,7,Fat Stanley Gibbons Baldwin's Auction
OL,8,FHouse, said of the coins: "Each one is
OL,9,Fa really important piece of economic
OL,10,Fhistory, propaganda and social
OL,11,Fhistory."
